  "evidencia": "Page: Shanghai Noon. Sentence: The film, marking the directorial debut of Tom Dey, was written by Alfred Gough and Miles Millar.\nPage: Tom Dey. Sentence: Thomas Ridgeway \"Tom\" Dey (born April 14, 1965) is an American film director, screenwriter, and producer.\nPage: Tom Dey. Sentence: His credits include \"Shanghai Noon\", \"Showtime\", \"Failure to Launch\", and \"Marmaduke\".\nPage: Roger Yuan. Sentence: As an actor himself, he also appeared in \"Shanghai Noon\" (2000) opposite Jackie Chan, \"Bulletproof Monk\" (2003) alongside Chow Yun-fat, the technician in \"Batman Begins\" (2005), and as the Severine's bodyguard in \"Skyfall\" (2012).\nPage: Once Upon a Time in Vietnam. Sentence: Once Upon a Time in Vietnam (Vietnamese: Lửa Phật ) is a 2013 Vietnamese action fantasy film directed by and starring Dustin Nguyen along with Roger Yuan.",
